## Quick start

```bash
bun install
bun run dev          # Vite dev server with HMR, on http://localhost:5173
```

Edit anything under `src/` and the page hot-reloads. To check the production
build before shipping, run `bun run preview` instead.

## Running the app

Two scripts, one for each mode:

| `dev` — transform, HMR | `preview` — compiled, production-faithful |
| ---------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |
| `bun run dev`          | `bun run preview`                         |

Reach for `dev` while building — it is the fast inner loop, with HMR and no
build step — and for `preview` when verifying that the production bundle behaves
before a deploy: `preview` builds the client and serves the built assets, the
same artifact that deploys.
