```

`test:e2e` is an end-to-end test *of the build*: it runs both server scripts —
including the production build that `preview` performs — and asserts that each
returns a rendered document and serves its client assets with the correct
content type.
<% } else { -%>
bun run test:e2e      # boots all six matrix servers and asserts each serves
```

`test:e2e` is an end-to-end test *of the build*: it runs each of the six server
